## Working on this service

- `dwe commands list --output json` — this project's declared dev commands; check
  it before tests, linters, builds, migrations and similar tasks, and prefer a
  matching command (`dwe cmd <id>`) over invoking the underlying tool directly
- `dwe shell {{ .Resolved }} -c '<cmd>'` — a one-off command inside the container
- `dwe logs {{ .Resolved }}` — stream this service's logs
- `dwe status` — stack health and container names

